  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c9876f83510731f4d97169c0d46b0606, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lucifer Greetings - DialogueLine 27
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - participant: 0
    englishLine: " I don\u2019t understand. If you were in Heaven, why did you side
      with Hell?"
    portugueseLine: "Eu n\xE3o entendo. Se voc\xEA estava no c\xE9u, por que se aliou
      ao inferno?"
    chineseLine: "\u6211\u4E0D\u660E\u767D\u3002\u5982\u679C\u4F60\u66FE\u5728\u5929\u5802\uFF0C\u4E3A\u4EC0\u4E48\u7AD9\u5230\u5730\u72F1\u90A3\u8FB9?  "
    spanishLine: " No entiendo. Si estuviste en el cielo, \xBFpor qu\xE9 te aliaste
      con el infierno?"
  - participant: 1
    englishLine: ' I never sided with Hell, my friend. I only accepted that Heaven
      and Hell are just two sides of the same coin.'
    portugueseLine: " Eu nunca me aliei ao inferno, meu querido. Eu apenas aceitei
      que o c\xE9u e o inferno s\xE3o apenas duas faces da mesma moeda."
    chineseLine: "\u964C\u6211\u4ECE\u672A\u7AD9\u5230\u5730\u72F1\u90A3\u8FB9\u3002\u6211\u53EA\u662F\u63A5\u53D7\u5929\u5802\u4E0E\u5730\u72F1\u662F\u540C\u4E00\u679A\u786C\u5E01\u7684\u4E24\u9762\u3002"
    spanishLine: " Nunca me ali\xE9 con el infierno. Solo acept\xE9 que el cielo
      y el infierno son dos caras de la misma moneda."
  - participant: 0
    englishLine: ' So you say everything is an illusion?'
    portugueseLine: "Ent\xE3o voc\xEA diz que tudo \xE9 uma ilus\xE3o?"
    chineseLine: "\u6240\u4EE5\u4F60\u8BF4\u4E00\u5207\u90FD\u662F\u5E7B\u89C9?  "
    spanishLine: " \xBFEntonces dices que todo es una ilusi\xF3n?"
  - participant: 1
    englishLine: " No. I say it\u2019s all a war...  and in war, what matters is
      survival."
    portugueseLine: "N\xE3o. Eu digo que tudo \xE9 uma guerra... e, na guerra, o
      que importa \xE9 sobreviver."
    chineseLine: "\u964C\u4E0D\u3002\u6211\u8BF4\u4E00\u5207\u90FD\u662F\u6218\u4E89...
      \u6218\u4E89\u4E2D\uFF0C\u91CD\u8981\u7684\u662F\u6D3B\u4E0B\u6765\u3002"
    spanishLine: ' No. Digo que todo es una guerra...  y en la guerra, lo que importa
      es sobrevivir.'
